v0.3b.r0	(ADD) ACP_FONT setting in ACP.STARTUP. still to do, a gui that is
	actually font sensitive.
	(BUG) The cycle gadget now works correctly with CycleToMenu.

v0.3b.r1	(ADD) semaphores for the nodes have been restored
	(BUG) in some places only 9 of the 10 nodes vars initialized.
	sometimes 11 node variables were used, instead of 10 (!?!?); all
	this probabily lead to unreliable operations of node 9.
v0.3b.r2	(ADD) now you can use TABS in the S:ACP.STARTUP (!!)
	(ADD) added back an AppIcon: ACP_ICON for the complete path to the icon,
	ACP_ITXT for the text under the icon. if ACP_ICON is not present, no
	appicon will be created.
